'''''Debate, Discourse Without Spears''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Ask about Axana's whereabouts with Aglaea and the others
# Return to the Demigod Council and inform Aglaea about things
# Speak to Castorice and learn about what happened

