===Ask about Axana's whereabouts with Aglaea and the others{{subst:void|<!--104030401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Demigod Council" Dawncloud|After discovering Anaxagoras had fled to the Council of Elders, Aglaea rushed to Dawncloud to confront the Council about the Coreflames.<br />The scholar appears to share the same condition as (Trailblazer). This might hold the key to {{MC|ж=her|м=his}} salvation.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:In the meantime...
:'''Aglaea:''' I have news from Hyacine and Dan Heng. Anaxa might be trying to do something with {{Rubi|Kephale|Worldbearing Titan}}'s divine body.
:'''Phainon:''' {{Rubi|Kephale|Worldbearing Titan}}? But what could Anaxa want...? Is the Council of Elders going to sit around and let such a sacrilegious act unfold?
:'''Aglaea:''' That is not possible.
:'''Aglaea:''' He is indeed "the Great Performer," capable of fooling anyone and everyone with his tricks.
:'''Phainon:''' I... I'm sorry.
:'''Aglaea:''' No need for guilt, for this is good news to us. The Council of Elders has found themselves a traitorous ally. Anaxa's ambitious desires will be something we can exploit.
:'''Aglaea:''' What we should be doing now is to keep our eyes peeled for whichever trickery Caenis is up to and react accordingly to thwart her plans.
:'''Aglaea:''' Being Okhema's political center, the Demigod Council holds just as much significance as the Vortex of Genesis. Someday, after my duty is over, this site will take the place of the battlefield where you hunt gods, become the next challenge you ought to overcome...
:'''Aglaea:''' Till then, it's best to get used to this place as soon as possible.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We will be waiting here for your good news.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Come find us anytime you need something.
:{{tx}}
----
:{{tx}}
:'''Krateros:''' It's been a while.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hello, Oleg of Amphoreus.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But we've never met.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It would be hard not to notice thunderclaps in broad daylight.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No, I'm a heavy sleeper.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hurray, it's Acheron! Someone's coming to save us!
::{{tx}}
:'''Krateros:''' It's been a while.
:{{tx}}
;(Unused &mdash; TalkSentence_140317514)

{{Dialogue End}}

===Return to the Demigod Council and inform Aglaea about things{{subst:void|<!--104030404-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Demigod Council" Dawncloud|update|After discovering Anaxagoras had fled to the Council of Elders, Aglaea rushed to Dawncloud to confront the Council.<br />Deliver Mydei's warning to Aglaea.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Разговор}} Listen
:'''Nosy Councilor:''' Haha, someone trampled right over the master's flower bed, yet the master only fumes in silence. Oopsie, there goes the reputation of the Council of Elders.
:'''Steadfast Councilor:''' Whose side am I on? Why, I'm all for the Council of Elders to reclaim their authority, of course!
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Caenis:''' Pfft. Hahaha...
:'''Caenis:''' You've done well, Lord Callictis. Let me take over and personally close this debate for today.
:'''Caenis:''' Dearest councilors, let it be known that I sorely miss the blissful times portrayed in lyrical poems. Back then, Amphoreus was home to nearly a thousand cities &mdash; each with their own local faith &mdash; while gods walked the earth and shared close bonds with humans.
:'''Caenis:''' Yet in the present, people from all over are forced to leave their homeland, to seek refuge in the holy city, where they hope to rest under {{Rubi|Kephale|Worldbearing Titan}}'s protection. All of us have long been in the same boat, with no way out of this plight.
:'''Caenis:''' We didn't have a choice in the past, but now... the Council of Elders brings to the table a new possibility. All I have left is one question for you:
:'''Caenis:''' Would you rather strive toward the unheard-of "Era Nova," or return to the prosperous "Era Chrysea" of our past? Make your choice!
:'''Caenis:''' Now, which of the two would lead mortals to an ideal future?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No hesitation! I stand by "Era Nova"!
::'''(Trailblazer):''' "Era Nova" is a path of salvation the gods promised. We should not have doubts in the Flame-Chase Journey.
::If it's possible to bring "Era Chrysea" back...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If it's possible to bring "Era Chrysea" back...
:'''(Trailblazer):''' But how are we supposed to send Amphoreus back to "Era Chrysea"?
:'''Phainon:''' We all know that "Era Chrysea" is a thing of the past, Lady Caenis. Please enlighten me &mdash; how does the Council of Elders plan to turn back time?
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Aglaea:''' You've finally arrived, Anaxa. So have you... Cas.
:'''Anaxa:''' Don't worry, Aglaea. While I know that you have many queries, could you continue to converse like how "the citizens normally do"?
:'''Anaxa:''' Tell me, dear citizens...
:'''Anaxa:''' If we successfully retrieve and return {{Rubi|Thanatos|Death Titan}}' Coreflame without anyone passing the Death Titan's trial, what would happen next?
:'''Caenis:''' The answer is simple: We will have a chance to rid the world of "death" and bring Amphoreus back to an era when all beings live forever... We'll usher in a new future that will be entirely different from "the Flame-Chase Journey"!
:'''Phainon:''' Your proposal is much too idealistic. As long as the black tide still exists, how can we go back to the old days?
:'''Anaxa:''' Remember what I previously said? {{Rubi|Kephale|Worldbearing Titan}}'s Coreflame is guarded by the secret power of the Council of Elders. Plus, {{Rubi|Phagousa's|Ocean Titan}} water curtain will be able to block out any external perceptions.
:'''Anaxa:''' Tell me, dear citizens: Have any of you ever seen even a glimpse of the threat that this person is talking about anywhere within the walls of this majestic holy city?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But this place will become the Flame Reaver's target sooner or later!
::'''Caenis:''' Oh? Could it be that you heard that from the Flame Reaver themself?
::Isn't this just survivorship bias?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Isn't this just survivorship bias?
:'''Caenis:''' If we eliminate death, then there's no need for us to fear that Flame Reaver, right?
:'''Caenis:''' Citizens, let's loudly sing the blessed hymn: "O beautiful old world, where are you now? O legendary Era Chrysea, return to the mortal realm!"
:{{tx}}
